                    r1_s4_hint: `Cost 1,200K-1,800K, permanently neutralizes threat, gains defensive patents.`,
                    r2_title: `Round 2 — Strategic Positioning (Months 7-12)`,
                    r2_desc: `Round 1 consequences unfold. The Kairos license advances to term-sheet stage. A <b>new cross-licensing approach</b> from a tier-1 automotive OEM presents 12 patents in your technology space. The VeloxCore developer community grows restless. The trade-secret investigation reveals Nexion AI is filing suspiciously similar patents.<br><br>Decide your open-source and licensing strategy.`,
                    r2_s1_text: `Open-source VeloxCore under Apache 2.0`,
                    r2_s1_hint: `Big ecosystem boost, developer goodwill, but risks patent exhaustion and licensing revenue.`,
                    r2_s2_text: `Offer a free Community License (non-commercial only)`,
